US-0101: Play page renders the game

As a player, I want the game on a dedicated Play page, so I can focus.

AC: Game mounts/unmounts cleanly when navigating; no console errors.

US-0102: Start screen + controls help

As a player, I want to see how to play before starting, so I’m not confused.

AC: Shows controls (move/shoot/pause); “Start” begins gameplay.

US-0103: Player movement

As a player, I want to move the ship, so I can dodge.

AC: Keyboard input works (A/D or arrows); ship stays in bounds; movement feels smooth.

US-0104: Shooting

As a player, I want to shoot, so I can defeat enemies.

AC: Space shoots; fire rate limited; bullets removed off-screen.

US-0105: Enemy spawns + movement

As a player, I want enemies to appear and move, so there’s challenge.

AC: Enemies spawn at interval; move downward (or pattern); despawn off-screen.

US-0106: Collision rules

As a player, I want hits to count, so the rules are consistent.

AC: Bullet→enemy removes enemy + bullet; enemy→player triggers damage/game over.

US-0107: Score + HUD

As a player, I want score shown during play, so I can track progress.

AC: HUD shows score and lives/health; score increases when enemies destroyed.

US-0108: Game over + restart

As a player, I want a clear game-over screen and restart, so I can retry fast.

AC: Game over stops updates; shows final score; restart resets state.
